OL,3,AAnthropic becomes most valuable AI firm
OL,4,Aas shares soar in stock market debut
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic has become one of the most
OL,7,Fvaluable public companies in the world
OL,8,Fafter its shares began trading on the
OL,9,Fpublic stock market, taking its
OL,10,Fvaluation to roughly $1.76 trillion.
OL,12,FThe artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,13,Fcompany's Thursday debut on the Nasdaq
OL,14,Fstock exchange was a crucial test for
OL,15,Fthe industry, given the huge amount of
OL,16,Fmoney being poured into advancing the
OL,17,Ftechnology.
OL,19,FAnthropic's shares flew past its
OL,20,Fallocation price of $83 per share,
OL,21,Fshowing there is plenty of excitement
OL,22,Faround AI.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
